ure enough to know who's good and  who's bad we saw what happened in the  october 2019 protest and the price we  paid  social media is very effective we can  watch and differentiate between  candidates who deserves and who doesn't  social media is much more important than  tv and newspapers but our problem in  iraq is that our social media is  partisan just as the country it's  divided into parties sects and paths  this adds to the challenges that  independent candidates face in every  election in a country where  politicization and divisions make it  difficult to get their message across  aliasing al jazeera baghdad
 

